"use strict";
// Mission data for the sales academy. Facts about Tequila Corrido come only from ilovetequilacorrido.com:
// additive-free, only three ingredients, no fake flavors, celebrity-free (the site says "It's not about flashy
// endorsements"), one of the first female master distillers, Blanco $44.99, Reposado $54.99, Overproof $56.99,
// Añejo $89.99, 21+ only. Wholesale terms, margins and sales figures are NOT public, so right answers never invent them.
//
// Every step has ONE right answer. The wrong answers are written as near-misses: each sounds professional and
// contains one fatal flaw (a made-up claim, a rule broken, a pushy move, a missing next step). They are all about
// the same length as the right answer, so length is never a clue. Tests check this (node tests/balance.test.js).
//   R  = [right answer, feedback]     RH = the same right answer worded more plainly (used on Hard)
//   E  = [one obviously wrong answer, feedback]     H = three believable wrong answers
// Easy shows R + E + H[0] (3 options). Medium shows R + H[0..2] (4 options). Hard shows RH + H[0..2] (4 options).
// rd / wd = how Trust, Interest and the third meter change for a right / wrong answer.

